flowchart LR
    Push["💻 git push<br>or PR<br>to main"]
    Dep["🛡️ dependency-scan<br>Snyk<br>fail fast"]
    Tests["🧪 tests<br>backend ×3<br>frontend"]
    Sonar["📊 sonarcloud-scan<br>coverage<br>quality gate"]
    Build["🐳 docker-build-push<br>4 images to ECR<br>main only"]
    DeployB["♻️ deploy-backends<br>SSM + ASG<br>instance refresh"]
    DeployW["🌐 deploy-web<br>web EC2<br>health checks"]
    Mon["📈 snyk-monitor<br>push only"]

    Push --> Dep --> Tests --> Sonar --> Build --> DeployB --> DeployW
    Dep -.-> Mon

    style Push fill:#334155,color:#fff
    style Dep fill:#f59e0b,color:#fff
    style Tests fill:#8b5cf6,color:#fff
    style Sonar fill:#0d9488,color:#fff
    style Build fill:#8b5cf6,color:#fff
    style DeployB fill:#0ea5e9,color:#fff
    style DeployW fill:#10b981,color:#fff
